---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const updated = 'September 2026';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | phb" description="Privacy policy for phb Paper Honeycomb Board (Quinocycle Sdn Bhd) — what data we collect, the third-party services this site uses, and how to contact us." canonical="/privacy/">
  <section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:720px">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:#666;margin:1rem 0 2rem">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <p>This website is operated by Quinocycle Sdn Bhd (SSM 202001029919), trading as phb Paper Honeycomb Board, of No.13, Jalan Taming P/1, Taming Jaya, 43300 Balakong, Selangor, Malaysia.</p>

    <h2 style="margin:2rem 0 0.75rem">Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect only the information you choose to send us. The enquiry form on this site does not submit data to a server we control — pressing send opens WhatsApp (or your email client) with your message pre-filled, and the message is only sent when you send it yourself. Whatever you include — typically name, company, email and your requirements — reaches us through that channel.</p>
    <p>We use this information solely to respond to your enquiry and to supply the products you ask about. We do not sell it, and we do not share it with third parties for marketing.</p>

    <h2 style="margin:2rem 0 0.75rem">Cookies and Analytics</h2>
    <p>This website sets no cookies of its own and runs no analytics or advertising trackers. Your currency preference in the savings calculator is detected from your country at the network edge and is not stored.</p>

    <h2 style="margin:2rem 0 0.75rem">Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>Some parts of this site load resources from other companies, which means your IP address is visible to them when a page loads:</p>
    <ul style="margin:0 0 1rem 1.25rem;line-height:1.8">
      <li>Cloudflare — hosting and content delivery, including the country lookup used to preselect a currency.</li>
      <li>Google Fonts — the Inter typeface.</li>
      <li>Unsplash — photographs used on some pages.</li>
      <li>WhatsApp (Meta) — only if you choose to send an enquiry through it, under their own privacy terms.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="margin:2rem 0 0.75rem">Your Choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to correct or delete the enquiry details you have sent us at any time by contacting us at the address or email below.</p>

    <h2 style="margin:2rem 0 0.75rem">Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:sales@quinocycle.com" style="text-decoration:underline">sales@quinocycle.com</a> or use our <a href="/contact/" style="text-decoration:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
